  "details": "When taking a photo with the Multi Layer camera mode and the Items mask enabled, it does not create the image for Items. \n\nTo note: The tooltip mentions it \"captures each layer of a photo\" yet the Local & Remote player masks get combined, this is undocumented besides some small text on the patch notes YT video.\n\nUnsure if this is a bug or intentional, since Items gets combined into the World mask.",
